[{"id":5502361087,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR_dd_w","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'd say this is half of the needed fix.\n\nOriginally:\n- this is a string variable, let's put the old int value in it\n\nThis PR currently:\n- this is a string variable, we can't use the old int value, let's put `null` in it\n- But `null` and `String` still are not type compatible\n\nWhat we should do:\n- this is a string variable, we can't use the old int value, let's put an empty string in it\n- The scope difference to your other PR is that it's fine for the string to be empty regardless of initializer code\n- I think you can do the same you did with `_get_default_variant_for_data_type` in the other PR. Although I'd prefer to put it into a dedicated `GDScriptHelper` namespace instead of keeping it on `GDScriptFunction`.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124419#pullrequestreview-5502361087","pull_request_url":"https://ap